{"label": "78909644aa3667a3e177", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "He", "refers_to": "Brian Harrington, the speaker's friend", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "yes"}, {"word": "this idea", "refers_to": "that you are the walking billboard for Bitcoin", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "the show", "refers_to": "Simply Bitcoin, this show", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "He", "refers_to": "Brian Harrington", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Brian Harrington has recently been pushing hard the idea (which the host has long phrased as 'you are the walking billboard for Bitcoin') that Bitcoiners' presentation affects perception.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "This is one of my friends, Brian Harrington. He's been on the show."},
{"label": "92605f87420c44b3b8f3", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "it", "refers_to": "the Bitcoin price of $68,850 / the market", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "The current Bitcoin price is $68,850, which the host finds brutally low.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "Alrighty then, guys. So, we're going to do a little casual Friday"},
{"label": "94bd089fb811e443f4a5", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "us", "refers_to": "Bitcoiners", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "this", "refers_to": "Bitcoin (as opposed to gambling/shitcoins)", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Bitcoin being lumped in with shitcoins makes Bitcoiners look like scammers and gamblers, which they are not.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "I endorse the message that Brian just said. It's like if we want Bitcoin to succeed"},
{"label": "994ca307911a9ee1eb79", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "this show", "refers_to": "Simply Bitcoin", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "you", "refers_to": "the lone Bitcoiner viewer", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "this realization", "refers_to": "the Bitcoin realization (becoming a Bitcoiner)", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Being the only Bitcoiner in one's circle is lonely, because when you come into Bitcoin you're the only one with that realization.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "As I've said multiple times on this show"},
{"label": "a714eb9413d3d1a6c3e2", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "I", "refers_to": "the host (Opti)", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "it", "refers_to": "the thing he said the other day on his account", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "The host recently tweeted that Bitcoin calls to the part of you that knows you can be better, and he has a saved draft rant about 'Bitcoin elitists for the win'.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "I also said the other day on my account"},
{"label": "e0ef020c20d3c577f58c", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "I", "refers_to": "the host", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "we", "refers_to": "Bitcoiners (the early Bitcoin community)", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "When the host came into Bitcoin, there was an idea that Bitcoiners were elite human capital — the smartest, who understand how the world works and would be the richest.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "I remember when I came up into Bitcoin"},
{"label": "756d28a8b35a6d73c005", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "this", "refers_to": "the Polymarket/Koshi prediction market chart on 100K", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "I", "refers_to": "the host", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "this", "refers_to": "the show (he started it earlier)", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [{"text": "100K Bitcoin before January 2027", "inside": true}], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Bitcoin went up 1% since the show started, and the odds of 100K Bitcoin before January 2027 are 6%.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "before I move on, I do got to plug the partners over at Koshi"}
]}
